Date><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59418</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Finish Second at John McNichols Invitational</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/cross-country-mountaineers-finish-second-at-john-mcnichols-invitational</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/cross-country-mountaineers-finish-second-at-john-mcnichols-invitational</guid><category>Cross Country</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Chelsea Chepkemboi running during the John McNichols Invitational" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09940.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University cross country team finished second at the John McNichols Invitational on Saturday at the LaVern Gibson Championship Cross Country Course, scoring 74 points.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09940.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09940.jpg"><media:title>Chelsea Chepkemboi running during the John McNichols Invitational</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09940.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59417</s:story_id></item><item><title>Golf Back in Action at Minnesota</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/golf-back-in-action-at-minnesota</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/golf-back-in-action-at-minnesota</guid><category>Golf</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Graphic of West Virginia's golf event at the Gopher Invitational" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_pr